course: dictionary
lesson: 9121
title: One word, several meanings
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and the context tells you which one the writer means. The word smoker can mean a person, a cooking box or a beekeeping tool. «Cigarettes contain tobacco and nicotine; smoking causes lung disease» is about people, so here a smoker is a person who smokes.
explain: Look at the words around it. A smoker who goes outside «even in the rain» is a person. A smoker used for cooking meat or fish slowly in smoke is a box or oven, and beekeepers use a small can that puffs smoke to calm bees.
explain: Swap your meaning into the sentence to check it. «Smokers go outside even in the rain» would make no sense if smoker meant a box, so the meaning of a person fits.
fact: A smoker is a person who smokes cigarettes, cigars or a pipe, usually often.
fact: A smoker can also be a box or oven for cooking meat or fish slowly in smoke.
fact: In beekeeping, a smoker is a small can that puffs smoke to calm bees.
fact: «Nicotine is very addictive», so a «heavy smoker» can find it very hard to stop.
fact: Smoking causes lung disease, heart disease and cancer, and «passive smoking» harms people nearby.
exercise: «Smokers go outside even in the rain.» In this sentence, what are smokers? | Ovens | Boxes for cooking | Bees | *People
exercise: Beekeeper Sam lights the smoker before he opens the hive. What does smoker mean here? | A kind of bee | *A small can that puffs smoke to calm bees | A person who smokes cigarettes | A box for cooking meat
exercise: «The salmon sat in the smoker for six hours.» What does smoker mean? | A can for calming bees | *A box or oven for cooking fish slowly in smoke | A person who smokes cigarettes
test: In «A smoker's cough is often a sign of lung disease», what does smoker mean? | A cloud in the sky | A can for calming bees | An oven for cooking | *A person who smokes
test: Which sentence shows that smoker means a cooking box? | «Some smokers live long lives.» | «Smokers feel uncomfortable until they have the next one.» | *«The salmon was cooked slowly in the smoker.» | «Smokers' lungs turn dark grey.»
exam: Find the meaning of smoker in «Nicotine is very addictive, so smokers feel uncomfortable until they have the next one.» | *A person who smokes cigarettes | A box for cooking meat slowly | A small can that puffs smoke to calm bees | A pipe for the garden
